// 1273 copy_runtime_symlink nonUnix -> jetos_copy_runtime_symlink_nonunix_body
//      public canonical jetos_copy_runtime_symlink selection stays explicit.
// 1277 write_jetos_toolchain -> jetos_write_jetos_toolchain
// 1322 jet_toolchain_candidates -> BOTH selected-target
//      jetos_jet_toolchain_candidates_{unix,windows}_body +
//      jetos_jet_toolchain_candidates_from_exe (selection #4483/#4500)
// 1350 copy_toolchain_runtime_deps -> jetos_copy_toolchain_runtime_deps
// 1360 copy_absolute_runtime_file -> jetos_copy_absolute_runtime_file
// 1392 Scratch.new -> Tests/GenerationFiles.jet::jetos_generation_scratch_new
// 1407 Scratch.drop -> Tests/GenerationFiles.jet::JetOSGenerationScratch.Close
// 1413 relative_store_symlink_target_returns_invalid_data -> exact #Test name
// 1433 absolute_non_store_symlink_target_is_unchanged -> exact #Test name
// 1447 generation_owns_full_closure_after_original_and_lease_are_removed
//      -> Tests/GenerationFiles.jet original real-lease/native-process journey
// Types44 GenerationRootProof -> JetOSGenerationRootProof
// Types854 PackageSnapshot -> JetOSPackageSnapshot
// Types900 PackageDiff -> JetOSPackageDiff; PlanMark stays Foundation/Terminal
// Const190 EVALUATOR_SEMANTICS -> JETOS_EVALUATOR_SEMANTICS
//
// Caller/publication hunks for Main (writer owns ONLY this source/test pair):
// JetOS source list += Jetpack/JetOS/Source/GenerationFiles.jet
// JetOS test list += Jetpack/JetOS/Tests/GenerationFiles.jet
// RootProjection/StudioProjection share this assembly; NEVER import CLI.
// Types JetOSRealizedPackage: original_out/consumption_override OSPath,
// consumption_path(String)->OSPath IOError!, original_output()->OSPath,
// output_digests(HangarRoots)->[String] from store_realize.rs65-83.
// PackageModel HangarRoots.root/hangar_dir/pkg_resolve_roots: raw OSPath.
// Store DurableSync.store_sync_store_node(OSPath,Bool) IOError! (Rust459),
// not invented StoreError.to_io; original file/directory/platform sync law.
// All native stage-writer dir/published_dir arguments migrate to OSPath at
// their OWN owners; their current String counterparts are not raw providers.
// Canonical Foundation quote/hash/UTF8, AST/parser, checked authority and
// Store verification/lease stay owned there. No second codec/resolver/hash.
//
// Complexity/ownership: diff name lookup O(n+m), sorting O(k log k);
// proof keys/cache are computed ONCE, never allocated per comparison;
// closure manifests are append buffers, not repeated whole-string copies.
// Original filesystem recursion (including source symlink-follow size loops)
// remains source behavior; no additional cycle detector or policy is added.
// Borrowed native spans/Close owners and OSPath map traits remain actual
// #4392/#4494/#4499 gates; source shapes do not prove allocation/native parity.
// Exact manifest hunk (Main ONLY; never activate unresolved natives blindly):
// Jetpack/Bootstrap/sources.list, "# == JetOS ==" after Types.jet:
// +Jetpack/JetOS/Source/GenerationFiles.jet
// Jetpack/Bootstrap/tests.list, "# == JetOS ==":
// +Jetpack/JetOS/Tests/GenerationFiles.jet
// Jetpack/Bootstrap/areas.list JetOS stays PackageModel, EnvModel, Store;
// NO CLI dependency or alias/reexport is added.
